---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <h1 class="hero-headline">Mostly<br />Human Stuff</h1>
    <p class="hero-subline">With some tech thrown in.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="headshot">
    <img src="/images/headshot.jpg" alt="Eric Angella" />
  </div>
</section>

<div class="hero-bio">
  <p>
    We're a family of four in San Francisco — and everything I do grows from
    that. Professionally, I help people stay themselves: ghostwriting for
    executives, building content strategy, and showing up for the humans who
    want to keep the human in their work as AI reshapes what work means.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 80px 0 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .hero-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .hero-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-optical-sizing: auto;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 76px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .hero-subline {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .headshot {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 168px;
    height: 168px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .headshot img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 35%;
  }
  .hero-bio {
    padding: 30px 0 4px;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .hero-bio p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hero {
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .headshot {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
    }
  }
</style>
